@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram


[*] --> ChooseAmount

state "Choose Amount" as ChooseAmount
ChooseAmount : entry / select predefined amount or custom amount
ChooseAmount : do / user selects an option
ChooseAmount : exit / selected amount displayed

ChooseAmount --> InputCustomAmount : [user chooses to input custom amount]
InputCustomAmount : entry / enter custom amount
InputCustomAmount : do / validate custom amount
InputCustomAmount : exit / custom amount accepted or rejected


state "Cancel Transaction" as CancelTransaction
CancelTransaction : entry / cancel transaction option selected
CancelTransaction : do / stop transaction and return card
CancelTransaction : exit / transaction cancelled

ChooseAmount --> CancelTransaction : [user selects cancel option]
InputCustomAmount --> CancelTransaction : [user selects cancel option]


state ReturnCard
ReturnCard : entry / stop transaction and return card
ReturnCard : do / return card to user
ReturnCard : exit / transaction completed

CancelTransaction --> ReturnCard : [transaction cancelled]

state PredefinedAmounts
PredefinedAmounts : entry / select predefined amounts
PredefinedAmounts : do / display predefined amounts
PredefinedAmounts : exit / user selects an option

ChooseAmount --> PredefinedAmounts : [user chooses predefined amount]


state C1 <<choice>>
CancelTransaction --> C1 : [possibilities after cancellation]
C1 --> ReturnCard : [transaction cancelled]

state C2 <<choice>>
ChooseAmount --> C2 : [possibilities for amount selection]
C2 --> PredefinedAmounts : [predefined amounts selected]


state MergeEnd <<choice>>
ReturnCard --> MergeEnd
MergeEnd --> [*]

state CancelTransaction --> InputCustomAmount : [user selects cancel option after inputting custom amount]
CancelTransaction --> ReturnCard : [transaction cancelled]
ChooseAmount --> ReturnCard : [user cancels transaction without selecting an amount]
PredefinedAmounts --> ReturnCard : [user cancels transaction while selecting predefined amounts]
InputCustomAmount --> ReturnCard : [custom amount rejected]

@enduml
